      "comments": "Restore the known PhaseId 1 as a scalar Int32 cell array, inheriting the recovered grid dimensions. Every original measured ROI cell is phase 1. This restores source phase identity lost by the label-only table; a multiphase or unindexed input requires its actual phase map, not a constant.",
