          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 1
      },
      "comments": "Restore Aluminum and cubic-high symmetry at ensemble row 1, with reserved row 0 created by the filter. Primary is the declared NX classification for the one indexed aluminum phase, not a new measurement. The 935 imported material-name slots identify grain labels, not physical phases.",
      "filter": {
